It seems to be somewhat short. All right, I'll explain it.
Stand on an non-coaligned altar, drop your potion of water and pray.
Of course your god will be displeased but you get what you want
since the altars god is displeased too and want to punish you
by cursing your water and make it unholy. Now the last thing
is to uncurse this water. I'm not sure how to do this. May be
a scroll of remove course?

